sentences.text:
For the foregoing reasons, this Court proceeds to pass the following:
2017 ACJ 2700 SC NC: 2024:KHC-K:9520 ORDER (i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
(ii) The judgment and award passed by the Tribunal in MVC.No.1546/2016 is modified;
(iii) The appellants are entitled for enhanced compensation of Rs.6,15,415/- which shall carry interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition till realization;
(iv) The apportionment shall be in terms of the order of the Tribunal;
(v) The amount in deposit, if any, shall be remitted to the Tribunal forthwith.
